With a longstanding passion for coding, technology and innovation, I started
Hackaberry to create a space where people can discover, explore and connect
through technology. I wanted to make these fields more accessible to those who
may not have had the opportunity to get involved, while also bringing together
people already involved in these fields to meet, share ideas and build
connections. Through Hackaberry, I hope to encourage more people to explore
their interests and feel part of the technology community.
